      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KEAYANG MINNESOTA (8) made it two wins from two runs this prep last start when she got the cash by 3.5 metres over 1609m at Geelong. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Taking on a better field but she is up to the task. LITTLE MISS MORGAN (2) found form and finished in the money two runs ago then came back to earth when she broke and finished fourth last start over 2240m at this track, coming home 14 metres from the winner. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Won't find this any harder so she can return to form. HARPERSEVEN (6) comes here following a Group One fourth eight months ago over 2240m at this track, beaten 13 metres by ADELAIDE RED. Proven performer in quality races; must be respected. LORD LOGAN (3) must be included after winning his past two starts, the latest at Geelong a week ago.",
